{"version":1,"content":"<p>據業內消息人士透露，SK海力士（000660.KS）準備公佈一份新增股東回報方案，規模達50萬億至60萬億韓元（折合350億至420億美元）。疊加其近期已完成的40萬億韓元股票回購註銷，這家存儲晶片廠商今年合計股東回報規模將達到創紀錄的100萬億韓元。受益於AI存儲晶片行情，公司業績有望實現歷史性高增，計劃通過大手筆股東回報舉措，推動估值躋身全球第一梯隊。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583916.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:00.839166+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:04:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.869616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.869616+00:00","content_hash":"d7e22c8a14d988d6da619f948fd7280443a53610119347ec807ee46becea85cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}